17	   page owns its own navigation, header chrome or toast host, which is what
18	   let the old portal drift into several unrelated header treatments.
19	
20	   Collapse state lives HERE rather than inside Sidebar, because the main
21	   column's left offset has to move with the rail. When it lived in the
22	   sidebar the rail animated and the content stayed put, leaving a widening
23	   gap for the duration of the transition. */
24	export function AppShell({
25	  children,
26	  initialCollapsed,
